+# GitHub discoverability metadata for Feathered
+
+This file records repository settings that cannot be changed through a source-code merge.
+
+## Recommended repository description
+
+Use:
+
+> Offline Linux package downloader and repository builder for air-gapped systems. Resolve dependencies and mirror APT, RPM/DNF/YUM, and pacman repositories from Windows.
+
+This description is intentionally literal. It supplements, rather than replaces, Feathered's more precise internal terminology.
+
+## Recommended GitHub topics
+
+Keep relevant existing topics and use the available topic slots for high-intent discovery terms.
+
+Recommended set:
+
+```text
+airgap
+air-gapped
+offline
+offline-installer
+package-downloader
+package-management
+repository
+repository-mirror
+apt
+debian
+ubuntu
+rpm
+dnf
+yum
+rhel
+pacman
+pulp
+satellite
+supply-chain
+linux
+```
+
+If a topic proves misleading or inactive, remove it rather than retaining it for keyword density.
+
+## Recommended release title
+
+For the current release:
+
+```text
+Feathered v1.4.0 — Offline Linux Package & Air-Gap Repository Builder
+```
+
+The first paragraph of the release notes should identify APT, RPM/DNF/YUM, pacman, dependency-complete acquisition, repository mirroring, and disconnected/air-gapped use in plain language.
+
+## Suggested social-preview text
+
+```text
+FEATHERED
+
+Offline Linux Package Downloader
+& Air-Gap Repository Builder
+
+APT • RPM / DNF / YUM • pacman
+```
+
+Keep the visual simple and readable at small card sizes.
